# g8e host launcher and Docker Compose environment.
# Copy to .env and edit for make full, or set inline: G8E_OLLAMA_ENDPOINT=http://192.168.1.2:11434 docker compose up -d --build
#
# Only secrets and user-specific endpoints or identities belong here. Platform
# configuration (ports, container names, model roles, service URLs) is fixed in
# docker-compose.yml and the g8e binary defaults; see docs/devs/devs.md INV-ENV-04.

# =============================================================================
# User-specific endpoints and identities
# =============================================================================

# Approved Ollama provider the Inference Operator calls. Required: Compose fails
# fast when unset. No Ollama daemon runs in the stack. The Inference Operator
# runs in a container, so localhost or 127.0.0.1 is the container itself, not
# your machine: use an address the container can reach (for example
# http://192.168.1.2:11434). Startup fails closed and the container restarts
# until the provider answers.
# G8E_OLLAMA_ENDPOINT=http://192.168.1.2:11434

# Hostname the browser uses to reach the gateway. Feeds approval links, host
# header validation, CORS, and passkey RP origins. Compose defaults to localhost;
# make full retains g8e.local when omitted. Set it for your browser hostname.
# G8E_HOSTNAME=localhost

# Same role as G8E_HOSTNAME for the User Gateway (g8ellama profile).
# G8E_USER_HOSTNAME=localhost

# Host launcher (make full) Operator locations. Omit to run each role locally.
# A remote host prints launch commands for that host; it does not run SSH.
# G8E_PROVENANCE_HOST=localhost
# G8E_OBSERVER_HOST=localhost
# G8E_INFERENCE_HOST=localhost
# G8E_DATA_HOST=localhost
#
# make full requires G8E_OLLAMA_ENDPOINT. Exported variables override .env,
# including empty values; values are literal (no shell or ${VAR} expansion).
# make full-setup retains interactive setup and does not read .env.
# Ports, models, and paths are not env settings. Defaults: per-role runtime
# ~/.ollama/g8e/<role>, detected local Ollama model store, local Ensemble.
# Override paths explicitly, for example:
# make full FULL_ARGS='--model-storage-root /srv/ollama/models --data-working-dir /srv/g8e/data'
# Preview: make full FULL_ARGS='--dry-run' (builds binary, starts no services).
